&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Hg9BdFwpFohWxMxSZP4lfNgug7f&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KH1Ud8VMSoXfiox9aDOlHTUqg1b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TkuhdzsUHop1Hjx4F6rl3A3igce&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HQACdwWjPoaLU6xU8oslhURQgSd&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfqndDD34oilMCxhCmLl6UCvgvg&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgiEeL21T921c06lmlMR8GOe&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgm1z0YXuoVauznLnFs1BpIc&quot;&gt;You will own the EEA growth campaign engine, which mainly comprises of 4 types: Affiliate, Listing, Trade &amp;amp; Earn, and New Product Launches. This is both a coordination and execution role. You will be the single accountable owner who turns a campaign concept into a shipped, measured, and reflected-upon outcome by orchestrating creative, media, lifecycle, BD, KOL ops, product marketing, and legal. The number on the campaign is yours. You drive the outcome.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DOk4dRsZ3o0gzHxe2AVl7sK5g6b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you will own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IUezdlbxJoQfXQxZ7emlv7f9gex&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Affiliate campaigns: Activation pulses on top of the always-on affiliate channel. Coordinated with BD and BD Operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpxIdwVQxoBM0kxrZWTlG4mggNf&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Listing campaigns: New token listing campaigns shipped within 24 hours of listing decisions. Tight loop with Listing PM, legal, comms, BD/KOL Ops, exchange ops.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PWLfdAjR0oOfB6xENDblaz39gDf&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Trade &amp;amp; Earn campaigns: Volume incentives, leaderboards, zero fee promos. Built around clear unit economics and incrementality, not vanity volume.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrHld8F9KoJA1lx4zrKlCfCOgOh&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Launch campaigns: Product and feature launches. Coordinated with product marketing, product team, social team, and lifecycle team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgvrMaQFHi8aGcJfgHxL2bWg&quot;&gt;What you will do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RyIgdIAA1o1bL7xBhsDlLRjRgLW&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate fuzzy stakeholder asks into clear campaign briefs that creative, paid, and lifecycle can act on without a six-revision loop.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUQ7dqYYzoUejXxOk7HlBtZlgW9&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and own campaign plans with clear gates, dependencies, owners, and dates. Hold stakeholders accountable when slots slip.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TBD0dy5n9oP65QxKEUulxeUjgCc&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define success metrics with analytics before launch, not after. Run holdouts where possible. Run reflection sessions within 7 days of campaign close. Publish learnings the team can reuse.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MS9IdZZ7jovz8exhUjIlmkkqgrg&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Navigate MiCA and MiFID II constraints with legal. You will not be the lawyer, but you will know enough to flag the risks early and propose alternatives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LaX2dmzEvoaBgpxp8gdlPtdugpf&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Be the connective tissue between EEA Growth and Global Campaigns. Localise global playbooks to EEA markets. Push EEA-originated wins back to global for global execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgvXW20O51JfrvH2JFbi9xAh&quot;&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h5 class=&quot;heading-5 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgAu0i04cbZHybWmlHABl71g&quot;&gt;Must-haves:&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QGdLdGBlzoIsR7xF6bFl29LCgsh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Four to seven years total experience, two-plus years coordinating end-to-end campaigns at a tier 1 regulated crypto exchange (Binance, Kraken, Bitpanda, Coinbase, or similar). You have shipped at least 10 campaigns with named numbers attached. And you have the receipts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GymBdL7juo2NdgxIGeUleWqKgFe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fluency in English and German, French, or Dutch.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CWqWdJKFpoQPXSxUuswl1C0sgyD&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on familiarity with EEA regulator dynamics under MiCA and MiFID II. You have shipped campaigns under regulator review and lived to tell the tales.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GFIedhTsloSOYoxWcKbl0Em8gdb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong brief-writing muscle. Strong project management muscle with strong stakeholder management across senior and peer levels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MdmNd4uvZoV4lRxtn7HlXndKgdb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analytical literacy: you can read a campaign dashboard, spot the wrong attribution, ask the right question of analytics, and present results to leadership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QPOCdrwW8oX64XxBrFilefcqgag&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Budget discipline. You understand CAC payback, ROAS, incremental volume, LTV.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-CvzrdB7BYoA8MBxlldhlfGwQgjc&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AuApd9M37o9NOlxsjFIlsXupgwc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Competitive. You want your campaign on the leaderboard against Global. You want EEA to outperform.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NusQdvKfso0nHBxO4ctl7ROTgRf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Crypto-native. You trade. You have a wallet. You know which tokens listed last week and which exchange ran the best campaign around it. You have opinions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XbOldZfJAoJ1HRxpwVUlcK9dgof&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Detail-oriented. You catch the wrong token contract address in a launch comms draft before legal does.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LOYid1K6foENtTx3fZrltgKyg7f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fast. The good campaigns ship within hours of the news, not days.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
