&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Munich, Bavaria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: €60,000 base salary + uncapped commission (circa €100,000+ OTE)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenTable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the face of OpenTable in your territory, owning the entire sales cycle from prospecting and relationship building through to negotiation and closing. In this field-based role, you will work across Stuttgart, spending a significant portion of your time meeting restaurant partners in person and the remainder working remotely. You will help restaurants grow revenue and improve operations by introducing technology that supports reservations, front-of-house management, and guest experience. This role requires professional fluency in German and English and a strong ability to build credibility with restaurant operators in a competitive market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t have an office in Germany so you&#39;ll spend much of your week meeting restaurant operators face-to-face across your territory, helping build trusted relationships and close new business.This field-based role combines home working with regular travel across your territory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, engage, and win new restaurant business within an assigned territory to grow OpenTable’s network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver tailored in-person and virtual product demonstrations that clearly connect OpenTable’s solutions to each partner’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with restaurant operators, share relevant market insights, and help them think differently about opportunities in their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop territory plans, manage pipeline activity, forecast accurately, and process contracts using Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet or exceed monthly and quarterly acquisition and revenue targets while navigating objections and competitive pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share customer feedback with internal teams and represent OpenTable through networking, events, and ongoing engagement with the hospitality community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consultative business-to-business enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success meeting or exceeding sales targets in a consultative sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery, negotiation, presentation, and time management skills, with the ability to use data to influence decisions and build a business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Google Workspace and Salesforce, a bachelor’s degree, and the ability to travel regularly within Germany for a field-based role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling software, hospitality technology, payments, or related solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in restaurant management or sales within the food and beverage industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using customer and market insights to improve sales strategy and provide product feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience representing a company through industry networking and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in hospitality and technology, with a collaborative and learning-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note; we have a global recruitment team, so ask that your Resume is submitted in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get at&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.opentable.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenTable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great work happens when people feel trusted, supported &amp;amp; excited about what they do — so we offer benefits designed to support your life, wellbeing &amp;amp; growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Flexibility that actually feels flexible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to &lt;strong&gt;20 days per year&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 vacation days per year&lt;/strong&gt;, 2 days off off your wedding, one for moving &amp;amp; &lt;strong&gt;your birthday off&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual &lt;strong&gt;company-wide recharge week&lt;/strong&gt; where the whole business fully switches off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠 Support for your wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company-paid therapy&lt;/strong&gt; through Spring Health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Headspace subscription&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;24/7 GP access&lt;/strong&gt;, legal support &amp;amp; more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Income protection &amp;amp; life assurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Investment in your growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/strong&gt; to support your learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership development opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to &lt;strong&gt;thousands of on-demand courses &amp;amp; learning resources&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ The extras that make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid volunteer days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive pension contributions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Resource Groups &amp;amp; inclusive communities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application or interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-FF1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Upsun (formerly Platform.sh)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun is the cloud application platform humans and robots love. It is built for today’s hybrid teams, where AI agents write and test code and humans focus on solving the problems that really matter. Developers, DevOps engineers, and platform teams use Upsun to build, ship, and scale confidently without wrestling with backend infrastructure. We give you your time back. You get:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Predictable performance, even at scale &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Secure, compliant environments by default&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Real-time observability and profiling built in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cloning, configuration, and provisioning in seconds&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AI-ready features that plug directly into your stack &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The name says it all. &quot;Up&quot; means uptime, reliability, and acceleration. &quot;Sun&quot; reflects our follow-the-sun-support, a 24x7, globally distributed support team keeping the lights on while you rest. Our core belief is that software should power brighter solutions and greater innovation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsunners are a remote, global workforce, and we thrive in a multicultural team. We are committed to open source and an open, welcoming environment. Our team spans the globe and the experience spectrum. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s our commonality, our cultural fabric? A curious spirit and a thirst for knowledge; an eagerness for innovative ideas and cultures. We believe we can build anything together in an environment that frees you to do your best work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌿 We make a positive impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;✨ We aim for the stars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💚 We care for each other.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Impact of a Senior Analytics Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Analytics Engineer, you will join our Data Science and Engineering team at Upsun to help our company make smarter choices. You will do this by helping us better understand our customers and internal operations. You will work with large amounts of platform and business data to create clear insights that improve our product and decisions. In this role, you will use &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;DBT&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Hex&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Metabase&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt; data tools. You will work on important projects like building new data models with Salesforce and financial data, or working with AI tools and cloud cost modeling (FinOps).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data modeling and architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;You will design and build models that turn raw data into useful metrics and data products, using DBT and medallion architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Metric design &amp;amp; ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You will define what success looks like for our products, setting up and tracking key business metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work with technical and non-technical teams to collect requirements, share methods, and teach best practices for using data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You will lead data modeling projects, choosing the right tools and planning how to complete the work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Scalable solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work efficiently with data of all sizes, including petabyte-scale datasets, to help everyone make data-based decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; You will guide partner teams by creating and explaining analytical metrics, helping them understand how data impacts different parts of the product and business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational efficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; You will improve our team&#39;s processes and code by creating well-documented solutions that can be used again in the future&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evolving modern stack:&lt;/strong&gt; You will use modern tools (GCP BigQuery, AWS S3, Fivetran, Hightouch, and AI tools like Claude Code) and help us improve our data architecture as it grows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Global remote culture:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work with a worldwide, remote team that values learning, open source software, and new ideas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;DBT&lt;/strong&gt; in real production settings, along with good habits in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Solid experience building data models for large datasets (up to petabytes) in cloud platforms like &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity and problem solving:&lt;/strong&gt; A passion for testing new tools, learning new technologies, and finding simple ways to solve complex problems. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; tradeoffs: &lt;/strong&gt;The ability to choose the best solution among different technical options, communicate clearly, and work well asynchronously. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience creating solutions and explaining them clearly to different types of audiences. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfort working in a remote team, managing your time well, and working across multiple teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prior experience working with FinOps principles or FOCUS data models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience or interest in building AI data agents and modern AI-assisted data workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, remote work isn&#39;t just a trend - it&#39;s our foundation. The freedom of remote work with the support of a diverse, global team has been our successful model for over a decade. Our culture celebrates flexibility and collaboration, and while we have team members in over 30 countries around the globe, we are currently focused on hiring for this role in&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;France, Germany, Spain, and the United Kingdom&lt;/strong&gt;. Although we’re unable to provide visa sponsorship at this time, we welcome applications from all qualified candidates who are legally authorized to work in these countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We know that a great hire won’t meet every requirement that we’ve outlined. If you can see yourself elevating the team, we want to hear your story. Few of us would be here had we not taken a chance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You can expect &lt;strong&gt;4&lt;/strong&gt; interviews on Google Meet to follow the order below. Should you successfully move through the entire process you will have the opportunity to meet with a variety of Upsunners. Our goal is to ensure you can make the most informed decision on whether this role, and our culture aligns with what you’re looking for in your future working environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
